How to setup a transaction replication from backup

-- Go to publication server, do everything using GUI (dont select snapshot option) and make a script instead of create. In script change below option.

exec sp_addpublication .. @allow_initialize_from_backup = 'true' -- default it is false and run the script.. GUI also available

--backup and restore the database from publication to sunscriber

-- goto subscription server create new subscription -> dont select initialize and take script instead of GUI
exec sp_addsubscription ..@sync_type = 'initialize with backup', @backupdevicetype = 'disk', @backupdevicename = 'c:\sd.bak'








